SUMMARY:Watchung Booksellers Hosts Justin Baer\, Author of House of Fidelity
DESCRIPTION:Watchung Booksellers welcomes author Justin Baer to discuss House of Fidelity\, an investigation into one of the country’s most powerful financial institutions\, on Wednesday\, June 17 at 7:00 p.m. \nIn House of Fidelity\, veteran journalist Baer tells the definitive story of the Johnsons—a New England dynasty that fiercely guarded control of their company while reshaping Wall Street\, and reveals a company and a family locked in a delicate balance of innovation\, influence\, and internal power struggles. \nJustin will be in conversation with Spencer Jakob\, writer of the Wall Street Journal’s Markets A.M. newsletter. Tickets are $5 and include a 10% discount on the book purchased at the event. \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
URL:https://montclairlocal.news/event/watchung-booksellers-hosts-justin-baer-author-of-house-of-fidelity/
LOCATION:Watchung Booksellers\, 54 Fairfield Street\, Montclair\, NJ\, 97042\, United States
CATEGORIES:General Events
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://montclairlocal.news/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Screenshot-2026-05-27-at-12.09.42-PM.png
