DESCRIPTION:Montclair will celebrate Make Music Day for the 13th year on June 21st\, and joins hundreds of other cities and towns acros the globe celebrating music and community. \nThe Montclair event will include nearly 100 performances at over 30 locations in town\, with the full/up-to-date schedule online at https://tinyurl.com/MMD26venues \nMontclair make Music Day is organized by Indie Arts Montclair as part of of th emontclair Make Music Alliance. \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
